ndicular muscle mass index (AMMI) (<7 kg/m^2 in men; <5.7 kg/m^2 in women) using Bioelectrical impedance analysis (BIA, TANITA BC-418®, Tokyo, Japan)\n-  Subject has lower handgrip strength (<26 kg in men; <18 kg in women) using dynamometer (CAMRY®, Zhongshan, Guangdong) or slowly gait speed (<1 m/s)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Older adults (≥ 65 years)",\n              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                "Older adults"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "≥"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "Older"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "65",\n                "6"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "≥ 65 years"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Subject has lower appendicular muscle mass index (AMMI) (<7 kg/m^2 in men; <5.7 kg/m^2 in women) using Bioelectrical impedance analysis (BIA, TANITA BC-418®, Tokyo, Japan)",\n              "Condition": [\n                "lower appendicular muscle mass index",\n                "AMMI"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "lower appendicular muscle mass index",\n                "AMMI"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "<"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "5.7",\n                "7"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "<7 kg/m^2",\n                "<5.7 kg/m^2"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Unit": [\n                "kg",\n                "m^2"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "Bioelectrical impedance analysis",\n                "BIA"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [