f the same strain as determined by\n-  species, phenotype and antibiogram.\n-  Patients must be able to swallow sachets.\n-  Must be able to speak and understand Swedish.\n-  Must have a permanent residence in Sweden.\n-  Must be able to sign informed consent in Swedish.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Chronic (more than three months) ESBL colonization of the same strain as determined by",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "ESBL colonization",\n                        "ESBL",\n                        "strain"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "ESBL colonization",\n                        "ESBL",\n                        "strain"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "more than"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "months"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "three"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "more than three months"\n                      ],\n                      "Acuteness": [\n                        "Chronic"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- species, phenotype and antibiogram.",\n                      "Eq-Unit": [\n                        "species",\n                        "phenotype"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "species",\n                        "phenotype"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "species",\n   