cerative colitis confirmed by Mayo Score assessment, and evidence of colonic inflammation.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "raw_text": "- Patients aged 18-74, receiving therapy for active ulcerative colitis confirmed by Mayo Score assessment, and evidence of colonic inflammation.",\n  "Age": [\n    "aged"\n  ],\n  "Eq-Comparison": [\n    "18-74",\n    "active",\n    "receiving"\n  ],\n  "Condition": [\n    "ulcerative colitis"\n  ],\n  "Procedure": [\n    "therapy",\n    "Mayo Score"\n  ],\n  "Observation": [\n    "colonic inflammation"\n  ],\n  "Eq-Value": [\n    "18",\n    "74"\n  ],\n  "Condition-Name": [\n    "ulcerative colitis"\n  ],\n  "Procedure-Name": [\n    "therapy",\n    "Mayo Score"\n  ],\n  "Observation-Name": [\n    "colonic inflammation"\n  ],\n  "Eq-Operator": [\n    "-"\n  ],\n  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n    "active",\n    "receiving"\n  ]\n}<|eot_id|>']
