inal or severe metabolic diseases, disorders such as diabetes, renal, hepatic or pancreatic diseases, disorders, ulcer, hyperthyroidism, malignance, chronic malnutrition, anaemia\n-  History or on therapy with medication known to interfere with bone metabolism such as steroids, hormones, diuretics, cortisone or anti-seizure medication\n-  Taking regularly any nutritional supplements and unwilling to stop for the study\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- History of serious medical conditions such as intestinal",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "medical conditions"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "medical conditions"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "History"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "History"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "intestine"\n                  ],\n                  "Severity": [\n                    "serious"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "or severe metabolic diseases, disorders such as diabetes,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "metabolic diseases",\n                        "disorders",\n                        "diabetes"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "metabolic diseases",\n                        "diabetes"\n                      ],\n                      "Severity": [\n                        "severe"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "l