ted chest X-ray by the emergency department of Vienna General Hospital\n-  ability to provide informed consent\n-  informed consent after detailed patient briefing\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- all patients who are assigned to a clinically indicated chest X-ray by the emergency department of Vienna General Hospital",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "chest X-ray"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "chest X-ray"\n          ],\n          "Indication": [\n            "indicated"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "-"\n          ],\n          "Location": [\n            "emergency department of Vienna General Hospital"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Assertion": [\n            "indicated"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- ability to provide informed consent"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- informed consent after detailed patient briefing",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "-"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
