t of ophthalmology, Saarland University Medical Center, Homburg, Saarland, Germany.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "raw_text": "- All Keratoconus patients presenting in the department of ophthalmology, Saarland University Medical Center, Homburg, Saarland, Germany.",\n  "Condition": [\n    "Keratoconus"\n  ],\n  "Condition-Name": [\n    "Keratoconus"\n  ],\n  "Location": [\n    "department of ophthalmology",\n    "Saarland University Medical Center, Homburg, Saarland, Germany"\n  ]\n}<|eot_id|>']
