ated according to the national protocol for diagnosis and care issued by the reference center for autoimmune bullous diseases of April 2016",\n              "Condition": [\n                "autoimmune bullous diseases"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "autoimmune bullous diseases"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "treated"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "treated"\n              ],\n              "Location": [\n                "national protocol for diagnosis and care issued by the reference center for autoimmune bullous diseases"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- patients having received written and oral information and signed informed consent",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "-"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
