cular surgery is programmed, and whose nature allows obtaining of arterial segment without any harm for the health of the patient\n-  Patient for whom a blood sample is planned on the day of the procedure\n-  Person who has received complete information on the organization of the research and who has not objected to his participation and the exploitation of his data\n-  Compulsory affiliation to social security\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Male",\n                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                        "Male"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or female ≥ 18 years",\n                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                        "female"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "≥"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "years"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "18"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "≥ 18 years"\n                      ],\n                      "Age": [\n                        "years"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patient for whom a vascular surgery is programmed, and whose nature allows obtaining of arterial segment without any harm for the health of the patient",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "vascular surgery",\n                    "arterial segment"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "vascular