, RPGN, lupus nephritis and etc.) on first diagnostic kidney biopsy, as per specified pathology definitions\n-  First diagnostic kidney biopsy since 2010\n-  Willingness to comply with study requirements, including intention to fully participate in protocol-specified follow-up at a clinical study site\n-  Informed consent and, where age appropriate, informed assent (clinical data, human derived materials including genomic data)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of glomerulonephritis (MCD, FSGS,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "glomerulonephritis",\n                    "MCD",\n                    "FSGS"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "glomerulonephritis",\n                    "MCD",\n                    "FSGS"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "MN,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "MN"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "MN"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "IgAN,",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "IgAN"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "IgAN"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "RPGN,",\n                              "Condition": [\n                               